@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0001>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0001" ;
  skos:prefLabel "digital product passport"@eng ;
  skos:prefLabel "DPP"@eng ;
  skos:definition "a concept or technology which enables sharing of product related information that is essential for product sustainability and circularity, including those specified in regulations, across all relevant economic actors"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Example characteristics include environmental sustainability, environmental impact, and recyclability."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Definitional conflict: the EN 182xx series (18216, 18221, 18222, 18223, 18239, 18246) define DPP as a \"digital record of product characteristics throughout its life cycle\" — differing in noun (concept/technology vs record) and in stated scope (across relevant economic actors vs throughout the life cycle)."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Definitional variant: EN 18219:2026 (§3.1.3) and EN 18220:2026 (§3.6) extend the EN-family definition with \"accessible via electronic means through a data carrier\" — a functional statement of the carrier subset of the ISO concept."@eng
 .